          "path": "_m/u/1/7/b/kamp-amersfoort-wp/dirk-arie-van-den-bosch-1884-1.jpg",
          "filename": "Dirk Arie van den Bosch (1884-1942).jpg",
          "caption": "Dirk Arie van den Bosch (1884-1942), a minister, was a Dutch resistance fighter during World War II. He was put in prison by the Germans at camp Amersfoort, where he died as a result of dysentery and a jaw inflammation.",
